Weirdo Jake is an alternate version of [[Jake|Jake the Dog]]. He resides in the [[Grotto World]], which can only be accessed via a whirlpool in [[The Grotto of the Water Nymphs]]. He lives in a regular tree with [[Weirdo Finn]].
