*Jake is a playable character in the 2015 video game [[LEGO Dimensions|Lego Dimensions]]. His Team Pack including him, [[BMO]], and [[Lumpy Space Princess]] was released on September 27th, 2016.
* Finn and Jake make another cameo in the OK K.O.! Let's Be Heroes episode "Crossover Nexus." Jake was a stone in the episode, and he and Finn were later used as one of Ben's transformations.
* In the episode of The Wonderfully Weird World of Gumball call "The Cheapmas" when the police car of the Donut Cop changes into different styles, Jake make a cameo.

